                        </StackPanel>
                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource Note}" Margin="20,2,0,0"
                                   Text="Tick either, both or neither (with neither, the trip and job summaries still count every event). An event flashes the light yellow or red for as long as a card would show. Between events one lamp stays lit for the recent driving, counted back from now on the game's clock: red if a red event happened in those last minutes, yellow if a yellow one did, green if none. Each event drops off by itself once it has been over that long (60 game minutes are about 3 real minutes on roads), moving or standing. A paused game doesn't count, and the light is hidden then."/>
                        <CheckBox x:Name="GMeterBox" Margin="0,10,0,0" Click="GMeter_Click" FontWeight="SemiBold"
                                  Content="Show the live g-force meter (now and peak in each direction, coloured by these thresholds)"/>
                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource Note}" Margin="20,2,0,0"
                                   Text="A small floating window with the same reading the alerts use. Drag it where you like; it never takes the game's focus. Works whether the alerts are on or off. Up-and-down g isn't shown: the plugin doesn't send it, and no alert uses it."/>
                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource H}" Text="Thresholds"/>
