                                   Text="Coaches and trucks each take their thresholds from one of: the defaults (coaches 0.35 / 0.7 g, trucks 0.4 / 0.8 g, in every direction); the coach mod (the passengers' g-force limits on the Coach passengers page: yellow at the normal limit, red at the harsh one, cornering from the limit across the coach, accelerating and braking from the one along it); or your own numbers. The defaults and the coach mod can be relaxed by 10% or 20%."/>
                        <Grid Margin="0,4,0,0">
                            <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                <ColumnDefinition Width="80"/>
                                <ColumnDefinition Width="220"/>
                                <ColumnDefinition Width="160"/>
                            </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                            <Grid.RowDefinitions>
                                <RowDefinition/>
                                <RowDefinition/>
                                <RowDefinition/>
                            </Grid.RowDefinitions>
                            <TextBlock Grid.Column="1" Text="Thresholds from" Foreground="#5A5A5A"/>
                            <TextBlock Grid.Column="2" Text="Relax" Foreground="#5A5A5A"/>
