                                   Text="Press Start capturing before you set off and Stop capturing when you arrive. While it captures, every harsh acceleration, braking, cornering and speeding event is listed here with its time, using the thresholds on the Driving alerts page for the vehicle you&apos;re in, whether the alert cards are on or off (speeding only while Speeding alerts is ticked). Click an event for its details. Keep this app open while you drive; the trip is kept until you start the next one or close the app."/>
                        <TextBlock x:Name="TripPluginStatus" Style="{StaticResource Status}"/>
